<title>USA: SPS says Thomas Schneider named chairman.</title>
<headline>SPS says Thomas Schneider named chairman.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERWOODS, Ill. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPS Transaction Services Inc said chief financial officer Thomas Schneider was elected chairman.</p>
<p>He replaces Philip Purcell, who will remain on the board.</p>
<p>Schneider will continue in his role as CFO, SPS said.</p>
<p>He is also chief financial officer of Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co. &quot;When the proposed merger of Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co and Morgan Stanley Group Inc is completed, Schneider will be chief strategic and administrative officer of the new company, Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co,&quot; SPS said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
